<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Our Fleet & Facilities</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Modern aircraft and state-of-the-art facilities at Kenneth Kaunda International Airport</p>
      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-blue-600 mx-auto mt-4"></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg fleet-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526281216101-e2f099559137" alt="Cargo Aircraft" class="w-full h-64 object-cover">
        <div class="fleet-overlay absolute inset-0 bg-blue-600 bg-opacity-90 flex flex-col justify-center items-center p-6 text-white">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Cessna 208 Caravan</h2>
          <ul class="text-sm mb-4">
            <li class="mb-1"><i class="fas fa-box mr-2"></i> Cargo Capacity: 1,500 kg</li>
            <li class="mb-1"><i class="fas fa-ruler-combined mr-2"></i> Range: 1,000 km</li>
            <li class="mb-1"><i class="fas fa-users mr-2"></i> Passenger Option: 9 seats</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Ideal for short-haul cargo and passenger operations with excellent short-field performance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg fleet-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556388158-158ea5ccacbd" alt="Passenger Aircraft" class="w-full h-64 object-cover">
        <div class="fleet-overlay absolute inset-0 bg-blue-600 bg-opacity-90 flex flex-col justify-center items-center p-6 text-white">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Beechcraft King Air 350</h2>
          <ul class="text-sm mb-4">
            <li class="mb-1"><i class="fas fa-users mr-2"></i> Passenger Capacity: 8-11</li>
            <li class="mb-1"><i class="fas fa-ruler-combined mr-2"></i> Range: 3,000 km</li>
            <li class="mb-1"><i class="fas fa-tachometer-alt mr-2"></i> Cruise Speed: 500 km/h</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Premium turboprop for executive transport with cabin comfort and reliability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>